Gadgetbridge

The Xiaomi framing, authentication and reminder implementation was developed
with reference to Gadgetbridge, licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later, from release 0.94.0
up to its 2026 sources: https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge

Parts of the Android source are ported from Gadgetbridge, AGPL-3.0-or-later.
Each file names its upstream sources and copyright holders in its header:

- Frames.kt: the SPP v2 send window and ack/nack/resend logic, from
  XiaomiSppV2SendWindow (Copyright (C) 2026 Dany Mestas) and
  XiaomiSppProtocolV2 (Copyright (C) 2024 Yoran Vulker).
- HealthCapture.kt: the 8/1, 8/2, 8/3 fetch sequence, channel-5 chunk layout,
  CRC-32 check and user info message, from XiaomiHealthService and
  XiaomiActivityFileFetcher (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 José Rebelo, Yoran Vulker).
- HealthFileId.kt: from XiaomiActivityFileId (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 Andreas
  Shimokawa, José Rebelo).
- HealthParsers.kt: from XiaomiActivityFileFetcher, XiaomiActivityParser,
  XiaomiComplexActivityParser, DailyDetailsParser, DailySummaryParser,
  SleepDetailsParser, SleepStagesParser and ManualSamplesParser
  (Copyright (C) 2023-2026 José Rebelo, Andreas Shimokawa, Dany Mestas).
- HealthParsersWorkout.kt: from WorkoutSummaryParser, XiaomiSimpleActivityParser,
  XiaomiSimpleDataEntry and the XiaomiWorkoutType table (Copyright (C)
  2023-2024 José Rebelo, Yoran Vulker).
- HealthParsersRecords.kt: record shapes for the parsers above (Copyright (C)
  2023-2026 José Rebelo, Andreas Shimokawa, Yoran Vulker, Dany Mestas).
- WatchNotifications.kt: from XiaomiNotificationService and
  wear_notification.proto (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 Andreas Shimokawa, José
  Rebelo).
- WristNotificationListener.kt: the background activity start, from
  NotificationListener.sendAllowingBackgroundActivityStart.
- WatchCrypto.kt and WatchAuth.kt: the miwear-auth handshake and SPP v2
  encryption, from XiaomiAuthService (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 Andreas
  Shimokawa, José Rebelo, Yoran Vulker) and XiaomiSppProtocolV2 (Copyright (C)
  2024 Yoran Vulker).
- AlarmsFeature.kt: alarm and sleep-mode commands, from XiaomiScheduleService
  (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 José Rebelo).
- ContactsFeature.kt: favourite contacts, from XiaomiPhonebookService
  (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 Andreas Shimokawa, Yoran Vulker).
- DataUpload.kt: the mass-data upload, from XiaomiDataUploadService
  (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 José Rebelo).
- DeviceFeature.kt: time, battery, device info and state, find watch and find
  phone, from XiaomiSystemService (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 Andreas Shimokawa,
  José Rebelo, LuK1337, Yoran Vulker).
- HealthSettingsFeature.kt and LiveHeartRateFeature.kt: from
  XiaomiHealthService (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 José Rebelo, Yoran Vulker).
- MusicFeature.kt: from XiaomiMusicService (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 José
  Rebelo, Yoran Vulker).
- QuickRepliesFeature.kt: canned messages, from XiaomiNotificationService
  (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 Andreas Shimokawa, José Rebelo).
- WatchFacesFeature.kt: watch face list, install and file parsing, from
  XiaomiWatchfaceService and XiaomiFWHelper (Copyright (C) 2023-2024 José
  Rebelo).
- WeatherFeature.kt: the weather encoding, from XiaomiWeatherService,
  XiaomiWeatherConditions and WeatherSpec.toBeaufort (Copyright (C) 2023-2024
  Andreas Shimokawa, José Rebelo, opcode).
- tests/HealthParsersTest.kt: byte fixtures and expected values from
  XiaomiActivityFileIdTest, DailySummaryParserTest, ManualSamplesParserTest and
  WorkoutSummaryParserTest (Copyright (C) 2023-2026 José Rebelo, Dany Mestas).

The ported files also carry "Copyright (C) 2026 Gadgetbridge contributors".
Android and database code was removed; decoding and protocol logic were kept.
Referenced Xiaomi implementation copyright holders also include Yoran Vulker,
Andreas Böhler and José Rebelo; preserve the upstream source notices when
redistributing. No upstream Java files and no proprietary APKs are
included.

